# /api/* is handled by the cortex-api Worker bound to
# cortex.redteamkitchen.com/api/* (see workers/cortex-api/wrangler.toml).
# These rules are a fallback ONLY if the Worker route is removed --
# Cloudflare evaluates Worker routes BEFORE Pages _redirects, so the
# Worker wins as long as it's deployed. Comment out the proxy line if
# you want to fall through to the Worker exclusively.

# Fallback transparent proxy (disabled by default):
# /api/healthz  https://inference.redteamkitchen.com/healthz  200
# /api/tags     https://ollama.redteamkitchen.com/api/tags    200
# /api/*        https://inference.redteamkitchen.com/v1/:splat 200

# SPA-style 404 -> custom page
/*  /404.html  404
